Z||000004||jlruiz67||07-12-2000||08:37 PM||||Hello <BR>I'm looking into doing the samething as you and I ran across the West Coast Fiero stand at WestFest2000 in San Diego. This is there site <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com/" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com/</A>  <P>I don't know how good they are or what kind of deal they will make but they seem like a good place to start.<P>West Coast Fiero<BR>13456 Beach Avenue<BR>Marina Del Rey, CA 90292<BR>Phone: 310-305-4111<P>Email:cwest@cwestco.com<P>PS. I do not have any experience with them beside WestFest.<BR>||||reg||1
